      "tier": 1,
      "title": "物理复制才是摆脱 DBaaS 锁定的关键",
      "summary": "CloudNativePG 的 Gabriele Bartolini 把托管数据库的锁定归到一处：WAL 流不对外开放。他的说法是持续的跨区域能力依赖 WAL 流，而托管方刻意不暴露，高可用与灾备的操作逻辑被关在专有控制平面里。他给出的退出路径分三步：先用逻辑复制搭起并行环境，再做一次受控切换，停机时间取决于复制延迟而非数据量，之后靠物理复制维持长期可迁移性。",
      "url": "https://www.gabrielebartolini.it/articles/2026/04/owning-the-pipe-physical-replication-cloud-neutrality-and-the-escape-from-dbaas-lock-in/",
      "author": "Gabriele Bartolini",
      "source": "gabrielebartolini.it",
      "source_date": "2026-04-14",
      "image": "https://www.gabrielebartolini.it/articles/2026/04/owning-the-pipe-physical-replication-cloud-neutrality-and-the-escape-from-dbaas-lock-in/cover.jpg",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
