    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "ClickHouse 再快，数据管道也拖后腿",
      "summary": "Tiger Data 的 Matty Stratton 承认 ClickHouse 分析查询比 PostgreSQL 快 10 到 100 倍，但基准测不出维护两套库的运维成本。把数据从 PostgreSQL 搬过去要 CDC、ETL 或流式管道，随之而来的是延迟、schema 漂移和新的故障模式；ClickHouse 没有 ACID 事务，订正要即时生效时会出问题。替代方案是用 TimescaleDB 就地做列式压缩与连续聚合。",
      "url": "https://www.tigerdata.com/blog/clickhouse-is-fast-your-pipeline-isnt",
      "author": "Matty Stratton",
      "source": "Tiger Data 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-04-14",
      "image": "https://blog-cms.tigerdata.com/blog/content/images/2026/04/thumbnail-blog-thumbnail-1280x720--1-.png",
